(7549366, 1209281, 97225, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I sat in front of it several times trying to come up with a comment, but couldn''t do it justice.</td>', 'I really like this. I sat in front of it several times trying to come up with a comment, but couldn''t do it justice.', '2017-12-22 00:19:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7549370, 1209266, 30861, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 9, you got 9th... I wonder, should I try giving you a 1 next time and nail you the blue? Or will you gently remind me that correlation is not causation, Bear, and 9''s will be fine thank you?<br/> <br/>BTW, since I am an editor, let me point out in passing that Dylan Thomas said "Do not go <u><b>gentle</b></u> into that good night. Old age should burn and rave at close of day. Rage, rage against the dying of the light." I can''t remember the punctuation offhand but those are the first three lines of one of the better villanelles written in modern times :-)</td>', 'I gave you a 9, you got 9th... I wonder, should I try giving you a 1 next time and nail you the blue? Or will you gently remind me that correlation is not causation, Bear, and 9''s will be fine thank you? BTW, since I am an editor, let me point out in passing that Dylan Thomas said "Do not go gentle into that good night. Old age should burn and rave at close of day. Rage, rage against the dying of the light." I can''t remember the punctuation offhand but those are the first three lines of one of the better villanelles written in modern times :-)', '2017-12-22 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7549372, 1209266, 68504, '<td valign="top">I am aghast at my misquote! I''m almost sure that had I said it aloud I would have caught it. I really only know Dylan because a friend used often to quote him. But you did not have to. I did intentionally change the latter part of the quote, adding the gerund to describe the recorded action of my subject.<br/> <br/>So pleased you like it. Next time, you know, a 10 would be fine.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am aghast at my misquote! I''m almost sure that had I said it aloud I would have caught it. I really only know Dylan because a friend used often to quote him. But you did not have to. I did intentionally change the latter part of the quote, adding the gerund to describe the recorded action of my subject. So pleased you like it. Next time, you know, a 10 would be fine. ', '2017-12-22 00:48:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7549373, 1209266, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow, t, this looks like something that pointy could have done.  Fabulous blurstract and mesh of colors.  Larger than life ambiguity. Think it''ll be flying up to 8th place soon. p.s. I thought for sure it was a pheasant immolation on your living room carpet.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-12-22 00:55:35.</i></td>', 'Wow, t, this looks like something that pointy could have done.  Fabulous blurstract and mesh of colors.  Larger than life ambiguity. Think it''ll be flying up to 8th place soon. p.s. I thought for sure it was a pheasant immolation on your living room carpet.', '2017-12-22 00:52:59.000000', '2017-12-22 00:55:35.000000', 0),
