(7549681, 1209128, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well<br/> <br/>Great nature study Ronnie. I like the way you have captured the bird in mid stripe with his yellow foot vividly contracted against the green background. There is a lovely level of detail in the bird with his beautiful white plumage again nicely contrasted against the dark background. I find the brown on the left a little distracting but not a lot you could probably do about that, other than that well done Ronnie for climbing another rung of the ladder towards your goal</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well Great nature study Ronnie. I like the way you have captured the bird in mid stripe with his yellow foot vividly contracted against the green background. There is a lovely level of detail in the bird with his beautiful white plumage again nicely contrasted against the dark background. I find the brown on the left a little distracting but not a lot you could probably do about that, other than that well done Ronnie for climbing another rung of the ladder towards your goal', '2017-12-24 16:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7549686, 1209286, 34659, '<td valign="top">Ken this is a really cool image.  It''s so ominous and impeccably executed.  The bird and the sky on the far right really leave the viewer wondering what will happen next...  :)<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Is the perspective tilted so that it is higher/narrower too?  There''s a lot to explore here.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-12-24 17:26:59.</i></td>', 'Ken this is a really cool image.  It''s so ominous and impeccably executed.  The bird and the sky on the far right really leave the viewer wondering what will happen next...  :) EDIT:  Is the perspective tilted so that it is higher/narrower too?  There''s a lot to explore here.', '2017-12-24 17:24:53.000000', '2017-12-24 17:26:59.000000', 0),
